of 2019, it likely increase in retail pricing due to 25% tariffs scheduled to go into place in early March 2019, as well as having a concentration of -- the higher concentration of new stores entering the comp base in the second half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2018 Q4","e":"fnd","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lisa G. Laube","x":"We've seen a few of the independents start to take price up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2018 Q4","e":"fnd","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayne Hood","x":"The gross margin rate decline was better than we expected due to favorable cost out negotiations and rebates with our vendors, as well as targeted retail changes, which were somewhat offset by higher and year-over-year inventory shrink and inventory reserves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2018 Q4","e":"fnd","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wayne Hood","x":"We intend to call these cost out each quarter and remove them from adjusted net income, earnings per share and EBITDA and have called out these estimates in our press release today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2019-05-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"We are pleased that the proposed 25% tariffs on certain Chinese-made goods that were expected to go on to effect March 1 have been postponed until further notice, as we believe it really better for our customers and our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/floor-decor-holdings-fnd-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2019-05-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"As you saw in the press release, we are updating our 2019 sales and earnings outlook to reflect first-quarter results and changes in the outlook on import tariffs imposed on products sourced from China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/floor-decor-holdings-fnd-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lisa Laube","x":"They were no sense -- to their customers, there were absolutely price increases taken.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/floor-decor-holdings-fnd-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"If you talk about the manufacturing public companies that sell flooring, as well as the retailers that sell flooring, most of them -- I think all of them talk about passing on price increases and as Lisa said, we certainly have seen it at the independent level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/floor-decor-holdings-fnd-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"And we were able to get a lot of cost out which really -- which helped us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/floor-decor-holdings-fnd-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"The merchants have done a great job getting cost out, as Tom just mentioned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/floor-decor-holdings-fnd-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"As we look to the remainder of the year, we believe we are in a strong competitive position to execute our strategies and navigate the unprecedented changes in the hard-surface flooring industry from tariffs and potential antidumping and countervailing duties.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"Let me first speak to how we plan to continue to mitigate the cost impact of tariffs on merchandise that we source from China, which has historically been the source of about 50% of the merchandise we sell.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"The improved product margins were due to favorable negotiations with our suppliers, improved merchandising strategies, including higher sales from our higher-margin installation accessories, and some strategic retail price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"So equal, that's not having to raise prices until -- or not having to raise as much prices as we thought, and we won't to have to do it as early as we thought.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"The reason our margin rate goes down during that time period, it is because we're not going to go markup on those tariffs, or just anything we can't resource, anything we can't get a better cost out, then we're going just to pass that bit of increase on to the consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"Lisa and her team have done a great job of sourcing and getting cost out more so than we had expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"Let me start by saying that we remain very pleased with our merchandised -- merchandising and supply chain teams' efforts to mitigate the impact of tariffs on our product costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"The acceleration is still expected to come from the strategic price increases to offset the impact of 25% Chinese tariffs, more new stores and in the comparable store sales base and the drag from Houston abating as we have now reached the second anniversary of Hurricane Harvey.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"So we haven't had to take a lot of the price increases that we had anticipated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Atul Maheswari","x":"So on the tariff-related price increases, just on the SKUs where you've actually raised prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"Moving to our pro partner services program, where we have an umbrella of service offers, which give our Pro a significant cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"We now believe we have a critical mass of partners, which will enable us to drive further engagement through our programs, umbrella of cost savings offered to our pros by our partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2019-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Trevor Lang","x":"I would say, we lowered our guidance in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q4","e":"fnd","d":"2020-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"Moving on to the impacts of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2019 Q4","e":"fnd","d":"2020-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"As many of you know, on November 7, 2019, the U.S. Trade Representative, USTR, made a ruling to retroactively exclude certain flooring products imported from China from the Section 301 tariffs that were implemented at 10% beginning in September 2018 and increased to 25% in June 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/floor-decor-holdings-inc-fnd-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"FND 2025 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"We're proud of our disciplined expense management and gross margin performance, which reflect the successful execution of our tariff mitigation strategies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/floor-decor-fnd-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2025 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"I think we've done a in fact, I've done just the opposite living through the tariff environment, mitigating that transitioning SKUs from around the world and a continuing tough environment to be able to grow gross margin in that environment, I feel pretty good about what we've been able to do.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/floor-decor-fnd-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2025 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2025-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"We've taken modest price increases as the year has gone on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/floor-decor-fnd-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2025 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Taylor","x":"We've taken more cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/floor-decor-fnd-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Langley","x":"From there, we anticipate slight to modest sequential pressure as we move through the remainder of the year, driven by tariff-related costs, the approximately 25 basis points incremental wraparound effect from our distribution center openings and reinvesting into value-driven pricing strategies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/floor-decor-fnd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley Paulsen","x":"And on the same token, take prices up to see what that impact is.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/floor-decor-fnd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q1","e":"fnd","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Steven Zaccone","x":"I was hoping you could just elaborate a little bit more on why the decision to lower guidance at this point in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/floor-decor-fnd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Langley","x":"First, we recognized a $45.2 million net pre-tax benefit related to the IEEPA tariff refunds, which affected gross margin, SG&A, and interest income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/floor-decor-fnd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q2","e":"fnd","d":"2026-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Langley","x":"…to the same period last year, driven primarily by a $56 million one-time benefit from IEEPA tariff refunds related to inventory we have previously sold through. The remaining amount of tariff refunds was recognized as a reduction to inventories net related to previously capitalized amounts…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/floor-decor-fnd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Langley","x":"The increase was primarily driven by the recognition of IEEPA tariff refunds as the related inventory sold through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/floor-decor-fnd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FND 2026 Q3","e":"fnd","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Langley","x":"As a reminder, we had approximately $22 million of IEEPA tariff refunds still in inventory at the end of the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/floor-decor-fnd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,10547,0,0,0,8652,1415],[37,1,10844,0,0,0,8359,1863],[38,1,10892,0,0,0,9092,1446],[39,1,1056